---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Photo from '@/components/Photo.astro';
import LocationStrip from '@/components/LocationStrip.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Our story" description="Discover the vision behind WANA, a spa taking shape near Crystal Bay, Nusa Penida. Rooted in considered touch, quiet spaces, and human connection." image="welcome" breadcrumbs={[{label:'Our story'}]}>
  <div class="wrap"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Our story'}]}/><div class="page-heading" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THE WANA STATE OF MIND</p><h1>A little less noise.<br/>A little more <em>you.</em></h1><p class="copy">We’re imagining a place where the most meaningful part of your day might be the moment you stop trying to fill it.</p></div></div>
  <div class="page-hero"><Photo name="reception" eager sizes="100vw"/></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="about-story"><h2 data-reveal>Rooted in place.<br/>Shaped by <em>feeling.</em></h2><div class="copy"><p>WANA is a spa coming soon near Crystal Bay, Nusa Penida. Our vision is simple: a considered space for a quieter moment, with people at its heart.</p><p>It begins with the warmth of a welcome. With the feeling of linen, the way light enters a room, and a conversation that makes space for your own preferences.</p><p>We’re taking our time with the details. The rooms, the rituals, and the final treatment collection are still taking shape. What we can share today is the feeling we’re moving towards.</p></div></div><div class="about-values"><div data-reveal><span>01 /</span><h3>People, first.</h3><p class="copy">Good experiences begin with listening. A thoughtful welcome and room for a real conversation are at the centre of our vision.</p></div><div data-reveal><span>02 /</span><h3>Nothing hurried.</h3><p class="copy">A pause does not need to become a project. We believe there is something generous about leaving a little space in a day.</p></div><div data-reveal><span>03 /</span><h3>Considered details.</h3><p class="copy">Earthy textures, intimate light, and a sense of connection to the island shape the atmosphere we are imagining.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="olive section"><div class="wrap intro"><Photo name="welcome" class="intro-main"/><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">STILL BECOMING</p><h2 style="margin-block:24px">A vision.<br/>An <em>invitation.</em></h2><p class="copy">The photographs throughout this site are AI-generated explorations of our intended atmosphere. They are not portraits of WANA’s team or photographs of completed premises. We look forward to sharing the real spaces and people as the story unfolds.</p><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/" style="margin-top:24px">Explore the concept gallery <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <LocationStrip/>
</SiteLayout>
